  "description": "PUVYIQ crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group C m c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C128 H104 Dy6 N10 Ni6 O52. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 6 O neighbors; Ni5 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 10 O neighbors; Ni6 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.380-3.888 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 87.84-108.33°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C128H104Dy6N10Ni6O52. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 10 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
